{"id": "ledgar/test/6377", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"Trustor will obtain and maintain, or cause to be maintained, in full force and effect at all times insurance with respect to Trustor and the Property as required pursuant to the Loan Agreement. In the event Trustor fails to obtain, maintain, keep in force or deliver to Administrative Agent the policies of insurance required by the Loan Agreement in accordance with the terms thereof, Administrative Agent may (but has no obligation to) procure (upon no less than five (5) Business Days’ notice to Trustor) such insurance or single-interest insurance for such risks covering Administrative Agent’s and the Lenders’ interests, and Trustor will pay all premiums thereon promptly upon demand by Administrative Agent, and until such payment is made by Trustor, the amount advanced by Administrative Agent with respect to all such premiums will, at Administrative Agent’s option, bear interest at the Default Rate.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Define